    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Sofia's Photography Webpage\r\n_\"I want to make a photography webpage so I can share my work and the story of how I got into it. I want a big, bold title with a line under it. And I want the photos to look like they're in a frame - like something you'd hang on a wall._\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://images.code.org/2a914c0a73a73a185f4d548bb8523cf0-image-1774476705361.png\" style=\"width: 40%\" />\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n1. **Build:** Use the AI Tutor to create this page step by step. Remember to be precise with your prompts!\r\n2. **Refine:** Keep prompting until your page is close to Alex's vision. It doesn't need to be perfect - just similar!\r\n\r\n> **Hint:** Try using `<img>` and `<h1>` tags for structure, and `border` and `text-decoration` for style. Not sure how? Just ask AI Tutor!\r\n\r\nWhen you're happy with the result, click **Continue**.",
